{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0000", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "上市公司股东减持股份管理暂行办法\n（2024 年 5 月 23 日中国证券监督管理委员会\n第 1 次委务会议审议通过）", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0001", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第一条 为了规范上市公司股东减持股份行为，保护投资者\n的合法权益，维护证券市场秩序，促进证券市场长期稳定健康发\n展，根据《中华人民共和国公司法》（以下简称《公司法》）、《中\n华人民共和国证券法》（以下简称《证券法》）等法律、行政法规\n的规定，制定本办法。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第一条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0002", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第二条 上市公司持有百分之五以上股份的股东、实际控制\n人（以下统称大股东）、董事、监事、高级管理人员减持股份，\n以及其他股东减持其持有的公司首次公开发行前发行的股份，适\n用本办法。\n大股东减持其通过证券交易所集中竞价交易买入的上市公\n司股份，仅适用本办法", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第二条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0003", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第四条至", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第四条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0004", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第八条、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第八条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0005", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第十八条、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十八条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0006", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第二十八条\n至", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第二十八条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0007", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第三十条的规定。\n大股东减持其参与首次公开发行、上市公司向不特定对象或\n者特定对象公开发行股份而取得的上市公司股份，仅适用本办法", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第三十条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0008", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第四条至", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第四条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0009", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第八条、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第八条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0010", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第十条、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0011", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第十一条、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十一条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0012", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第十八条、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十八条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0013", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第二十八条至", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第二十八条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0014", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第三十条的规定。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第三十条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0015", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第三条 上市公司股东可以通过证券交易所的证券交易、协\n议转让及法律、行政法规允许的其他方式减持股份。\n1", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第三条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0016", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 2, "text": "第四条 上市公司股东应当遵守《公司法》《证券法》和有关\n法律、行政法规，中国证券监督管理委员会（以下简称中国证监\n会）规章、规范性文件以及证券交易所规则中关于股份转让的限\n制性规定。\n上市公司股东就限制股份转让作出承诺的，应当严格遵守。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第四条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0017", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 2, "text": "第五条 上市公司股东减持股份，应当按照法律、行政法规\n和本办法，以及证券交易所规则履行信息披露义务，保证披露的\n信息真实、准确、完整。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第五条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0018", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 2, "text": "第六条 大股东减持股份应当规范、理性、有序，充分关注\n上市公司及中小股东的利益。\n上市公司应当及时了解股东减持本公司股份的情况，主动做\n好规则提示。上市公司董事会秘书应当每季度检查大股东减持本\n公司股份的情况。发现违法违规的，应当及时向中国证监会、证\n券交易所报告。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第六条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0019", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 2, "text": "第七条 存在下列情形之一的，大股东不得减持本公司股份：", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第七条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0020", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 2, "text": "（一）该股东因涉嫌与本上市公司有关的证券期货违法犯\n罪，被中国证监会立案调查或者被司法机关立案侦查，或者被行\n政处罚、判处刑罚未满六个月的；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0021", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 2, "text": "（二）该股东因涉及与本上市公司有关的违法违规，被证券\n交易所公开谴责未满三个月的；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0022", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 2, "text": "（三）该股东因涉及证券期货违法，被中国证监会行政处罚，\n尚未足额缴纳罚没款的，但法律、行政法规另有规定,或者减持\n2", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0023", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "资金用于缴纳罚没款的除外；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0024", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "（四）中国证监会规定的其他情形。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0025", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "第八条 存在下列情形之一的，上市公司控股股东、实际控\n制人不得减持本公司股份：", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第八条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0026", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "（一）上市公司因涉嫌证券期货违法犯罪，被中国证监会立\n案调查或者被司法机关立案侦查，或者被行政处罚、判处刑罚未\n满六个月的；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0027", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "（二）上市公司被证券交易所公开谴责未满三个月的；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0028", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "（三）上市公司可能触及重大违法强制退市情形，在证券交\n易所规定的限制转让期限内的；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0029", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "（四）中国证监会规定的其他情形。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0030", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "第九条 大股东计划通过证券交易所集中竞价交易或者大宗\n交易方式减持股份的，应当在首次卖出前十五个交易日向证券交\n易所报告并披露减持计划。\n减持计划应当包括下列内容：", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第九条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0031", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "（一）拟减持股份的数量、来源；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0032", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "（二）减持的时间区间、价格区间、方式和原因。减持时间\n区间应当符合证券交易所的规定；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0033", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "（三）不存在本办法", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0034", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "第七条、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第七条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0035", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "第八条、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第八条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0036", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "第十条、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0037", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "第十一条规\n定情形的说明；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十一条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0038", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "（四）证券交易所规定的其他内容。\n减持计划实施完毕的，大股东应当在二个交易日内向证券交\n3", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0039", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 4, "text": "易所报告，并予公告；在预先披露的减持时间区间内，未实施减\n持或者减持计划未实施完毕的，应当在减持时间区间届满后的二\n个交易日内向证券交易所报告，并予公告。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0040", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 4, "text": "第十条 存在下列情形之一的，控股股东、实际控制人不得\n通过证券交易所集中竞价交易或者大宗交易方式减持股份，但已\n经按照本办法", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0041", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 4, "text": "第九条规定披露减持计划，或者中国证监会另有规\n定的除外：", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第九条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0042", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 4, "text": "（一）最近三个已披露经审计的年度报告的会计年度未实施\n现金分红或者累计现金分红金额低于同期年均归属于上市公司\n股东净利润的百分之三十的，但其中净利润为负的会计年度不纳\n入计算；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0043", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 4, "text": "（二）最近二十个交易日中，任一日股票收盘价（向后复权）\n低于最近一个会计年度或者最近一期财务报告期末每股归属于\n上市公司股东的净资产的。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0044", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 4, "text": "第十一条 最近二十个交易日中，任一日股票收盘价（向后\n复权）低于首次公开发行时的股票发行价格的，上市公司首次公\n开发行时的控股股东、实际控制人及其一致行动人不得通过证券\n交易所集中竞价交易或者大宗交易方式减持股份，但已经按照本\n办法", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十一条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0045", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 4, "text": "第九条规定披露减持计划，或者中国证监会另有规定的除\n外。\n上市公司在首次公开发行时披露无控股股东、实际控制人\n的，首次公开发行时持股百分之五以上的第一大股东及其一致行\n4", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第九条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0046", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "动人应当遵守前款规定。\n前两款规定的主体不具有相关身份后，应当继续遵守本条前\n两款规定。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0047", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "第十二条 大股东通过证券交易所集中竞价交易减持股份，\n或者其他股东通过证券交易所集中竞价交易减持其持有的公司\n首次公开发行前发行的股份的，三个月内减持股份的总数不得超\n过公司股份总数的百分之一。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十二条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0048", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "第十三条 大股东通过协议转让方式减持股份，或者其他股\n东通过协议转让方式减持其持有的公司首次公开发行前发行的\n股份的，股份出让方、受让方应当遵守证券交易所有关协议转让\n的规定，股份受让方在受让后六个月内不得减持其所受让的股\n份。\n大股东通过协议转让方式减持股份，导致其不再具有大股东\n身份的，应当在减持后六个月内继续遵守本办法", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十三条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0049", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "第九条、第十二\n条、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第九条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0050", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "第十四条的规定。控股股东、实际控制人通过协议转让方式\n减持股份导致其不再具有控股股东、实际控制人身份的，还应当\n在减持后六个月内继续遵守本办法", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十四条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0051", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "第十条的规定。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0052", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "第十四条 大股东通过大宗交易方式减持股份，或者其他股\n东通过大宗交易方式减持其持有的公司首次公开发行前发行的\n股份的，三个月内减持股份的总数不得超过公司股份总数的百分\n之二；股份受让方在受让后六个月内不得减持其所受让的股份。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十四条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0053", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "第十五条 股东因司法强制执行或者股票质押、融资融券、\n5", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十五条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0054", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 6, "text": "约定购回式证券交易违约处置等减持股份的，应当根据具体减持\n方式分别适用本办法的相关规定，并遵守证券交易所的相关规\n则。\n大股东所持股份被人民法院通过证券交易所集中竞价交易\n或者大宗交易方式强制执行的，应当在收到相关执行通知后二个\n交易日内披露，不适用本办法", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0055", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 6, "text": "第九条", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第九条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0056", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 6, "text": "第一款、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0057", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 6, "text": "第二款的规定。披\n露内容应当包括拟处置股份数量、来源、减持方式、时间区间等。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0058", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 6, "text": "第十六条 因离婚、法人或者非法人组织终止、公司分立等\n导致上市公司大股东减持股份的，股份过出方、过入方应当在股\n票过户后持续共同遵守本办法关于大股东减持股份的规定；上市\n公司大股东为控股股东、实际控制人的，股份过出方、过入方还\n应当在股票过户后持续共同遵守本办法关于控股股东、实际控制\n人减持股份的规定。法律、行政法规、中国证监会另有规定的除\n外。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十六条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0059", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 6, "text": "第十七条 因赠与、可交换公司债券换股、认购或者申购 ETF\n等导致上市公司股东减持股份的，股份过出方、过入方应当遵守\n证券交易所的规定。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十七条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0060", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 6, "text": "第十八条 大股东不得融券卖出本公司股份，不得开展以本\n公司股票为合约标的物的衍生品交易。\n持有的股份在法律、行政法规、中国证监会规章、规范性文\n件、证券交易所规则规定的限制转让期限内或者存在其他不得减\n持情形的，上市公司股东不得通过转融通出借该部分股份，不得\n6", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十八条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0061", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 7, "text": "融券卖出本公司股份。上市公司股东在获得具有限制转让期限的\n股份前，存在尚未了结的该上市公司股份融券合约的，应当在获\n得相关股份前了结融券合约。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0062", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 7, "text": "第十九条 上市公司股东通过询价转让、配售等方式减持首\n次公开发行前发行的股份的，应当遵守证券交易所关于减持方\n式、程序、价格、比例及后续转让事项的规定。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十九条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0063", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 7, "text": "第二十条 大股东与其一致行动人应当共同遵守本办法关于\n大股东减持股份的规定。控股股东、实际控制人与其一致行动人\n应当共同遵守本办法关于控股股东、实际控制人减持股份的规\n定。\n本办法规定的一致行动人按照《上市公司收购管理办法》认\n定。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第二十条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0064", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 7, "text": "第二十一条 大股东与其一致行动人解除一致行动关系的，\n相关方应当在六个月内继续共同遵守本办法关于大股东减持股\n份的规定。大股东为控股股东、实际控制人的，相关方还应当在\n六个月内继续共同遵守本办法", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第二十一条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0065", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 7, "text": "第八条、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第八条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0066", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 7, "text": "第十条的规定。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0067", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 7, "text": "第二十二条 计算上市公司股东持股比例时，应当将其通过\n普通证券账户、信用证券账户以及利用他人账户所持同一家上市\n公司的股份，以及通过转融通出借但尚未归还或者通过约定购回\n式证券交易卖出但尚未购回的股份合并计算。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第二十二条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0068", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 7, "text": "第二十三条 上市公司披露无控股股东、实际控制人的，第\n一大股东应当遵守本办法关于控股股东、实际控制人的规定，但\n7", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第二十三条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0069", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 8, "text": "是持有上市公司股份低于百分之五的除外。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0070", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 8, "text": "第二十四条 上市公司董事、监事、高级管理人员以及核心\n技术人员或者核心业务人员等减持本公司股份的，还应当遵守\n《上市公司董事、监事和高级管理人员所持本公司股份及其变动\n管理规则》等中国证监会其他规定以及证券交易所规则。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第二十四条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0071", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 8, "text": "第二十五条 存托凭证持有人减持境外发行人在境内发行的\n存托凭证的，参照适用本办法。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第二十五条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0072", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 8, "text": "第二十六条 中国证监会、证券交易所对创业投资基金、私\n募股权投资基金等减持股份另有规定的，从其规定。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第二十六条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0073", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 8, "text": "第二十七条 中国证监会对北京证券交易所上市公司股东减\n持股份另有规定的，从其规定。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第二十七条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0074", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 8, "text": "第二十八条 上市公司股东、实际控制人不得通过任何方式\n或者安排规避本办法、中国证监会其他规定以及证券交易所的规\n则。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第二十八条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0075", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 8, "text": "第二十九条 上市公司股东减持股份违反本办法、中国证监\n会其他规定的，为防范市场风险，维护市场秩序，中国证监会可\n以采取责令购回违规减持股份并向上市公司上缴价差、监管谈\n话、出具警示函等监管措施。\n上市公司股东按照前款规定购回违规减持的股份的，不适用\n《证券法》", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第二十九条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0076", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 8, "text": "第四十四条的规定。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第四十四条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0077", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 8, "text": "第三十条 上市公司股东存在下列情形之一的，中国证监会\n依照《证券法》", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第三十条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0078", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 8, "text": "第一百八十六条处罚；情节严重的，中国证监会\n8", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第一百八十六条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0079", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 9, "text": "可以对有关责任人员采取证券市场禁入的措施：", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0080", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 9, "text": "（一）违反本办法", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0081", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 9, "text": "第七条、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第七条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0082", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 9, "text": "第八条、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第八条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0083", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 9, "text": "第十条、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0084", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 9, "text": "第十一条、第\n十三条、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十一条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0085", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 9, "text": "第十四条规定，在不得减持的期限内减持股份的；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十四条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0086", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 9, "text": "（二）违反本办法", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0087", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 9, "text": "第九条规定，未预先披露减持计划，或者\n披露的减持计划不符合规定减持股份的；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第九条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0088", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 9, "text": "（三）违反本办法", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0089", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 9, "text": "第十二条、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十二条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0090", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 9, "text": "第十四条规定，超出规定的比\n例减持股份的；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十四条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0091", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 9, "text": "（四）违反本办法", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0092", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 9, "text": "第十五条、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十五条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0093", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 9, "text": "第十六条、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十六条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0094", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 9, "text": "第十八条、第二十\n条、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十八条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0095", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 9, "text": "第二十一条规定减持股份的；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第二十一条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0096", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 9, "text": "（五）其他违反法律、行政法规和中国证监会规定减持股份\n的情形。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0011_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0011_att1::c0097", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 9, "text": "第三十一条 本办法自公布之日起施行。《上市公司股东、董\n监高减持股份的若干规定》（证监会公告〔2017〕9 号）同时废\n止。\n9", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第三十一条"]}
